Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Header,,0,0,0,,This is a Gentlemen of the Hàn free fansub.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.90,0:00:07.00,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,1665,4940,6100)\pos(640,468.296)}Episode 17 \N\N\N\N\NHanging the Seal and Locking the Gold
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.37,0:00:18.30,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,After Cao Cao accepted Guan Yu's three conditions,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.30,0:00:19.94,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Guan Yu missed Liu Bei on one side,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.94,0:00:27.12,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,and took care of Ladies Gan and Mi on the other,\N whilst following Cao Cao to Xudu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.43,0:00:32.89,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Liu Bei lost Xiaopei, Xu Province,\N Xiapi in rapid succession,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.89,0:00:35.08,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,forcing him to join Yuan Shao.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.66,0:00:40.83,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Zhang Fei broke out of a heavy siege and left for Mount Mangdang.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.63,0:00:48.55,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Sisters-in-law, you must be exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.55,0:00:52.21,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,We still need to travel tomorrow, so please rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.77,0:00:54.70,Default,Lady Gan & Lady Mi,0,0,0,,You must be exhausted as well,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.70,0:00:56.98,Default,Lady Gan & Lady Mi,0,0,0,,so please return and rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.78,0:01:11.84,Default,Old Servant,0,0,0,,General, please rest. We will take our leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.55,0:01:15.22,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Lead me to the living quarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.45,0:01:20.87,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Will you go? Lead me to the living quarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.06,0:01:25.88,Default,Old Servant,0,0,0,,The main army is sleeping in the streets.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.88,0:01:28.44,Default,Old Servant,0,0,0,,It'd be hard for you to escort the two ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.98,0:01:30.76,Default,Old Servant,0,0,0,,I received the Chancellor's order.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.76,0:01:34.67,Default,Old Servant,0,0,0,,This room was arranged for you and the two ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.20,0:01:37.44,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(294.571,459.429)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1820,2240)}Guān Yǔ\NStyled: Yúncháng
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.18,0:01:35.95,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.02,0:01:38.34,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Just this room?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.34,0:01:39.94,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,For me and the two ladies?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.46,0:01:43.10,Default,Old Servant,0,0,0,,General, I truly do not know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.10,0:01:47.16,Default,Old Servant,0,0,0,,The Chancellor did personally\N arrange these living quarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.76,0:01:49.00,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,How rude!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.41,0:02:01.49,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Does he want to ruin my name, disrupting the bond between lord and subject?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.06,0:02:43.66,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(600,327)\fade(255,0,255,0,500,2060,2580)}Cáo Cāo \NStyled: Mèngdé
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.33,0:02:42.14,Default,Old Servant,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.19,0:02:46.72,Default,Old Servant,0,0,0,,On your orders, I was keeping watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.72,0:02:52.21,Default,Old Servant,0,0,0,,But General Guan has been outside all night, he simply won't sway.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.30,0:03:07.28,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,You must serve the ladies well!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.28,0:03:08.03,Default,Servant,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.15,0:03:13.92,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Chancellor Cao!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.71,0:03:41.91,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,I see your war-cloak is well-worn.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.81,0:03:48.36,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Let this fine silk replace it, I had it made just for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.22,0:03:54.12,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,The distance to Xudu is significant.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.12,0:03:57.38,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,For all that could trouble you on the road,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.38,0:03:59.40,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,I hope you will forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.11,0:04:02.65,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,That...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.32,0:04:20.76,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Everyone, come and take a good look.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.89,0:04:26.36,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,It fits well, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.72,0:04:42.90,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Yunchang?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.20,0:04:46.40,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Why are you so modest?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.12,0:04:53.62,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12}It is not due to modesty. This old cloak was gifted to me by Imperial Uncle Liu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.62,0:04:55.42,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Wearing it is as seeing my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.42,0:05:01.38,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12}I cannot wear what Chancellor has given me and forget my elder brother's grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.38,0:05:03.72,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}That is why I wear it on the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.63,0:05:09.91,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}You are indeed a man of principle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.45,0:05:12.46,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Thanks, Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.82,0:05:17.32,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.98,0:05:26.11,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Yunchang, why is your mount so feeble?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.22,0:05:35.10,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,It cannot bear my heavy load, thus it is feeble.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.06,0:05:50.44,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Yunchang, do you recognize this horse?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.56,0:05:58.40,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Could this be... Lü Bu's mount, the Red Hare?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.02,0:06:06.36,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Sir, why not ride it for me to see?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.39,0:06:36.32,Default,Cai Yang,0,0,0,,This is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.32,0:06:39.67,Default,Cai Yang,0,0,0,,If Guan Yu gets that horse, he will escape us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.48,0:06:52.20,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Yunchang would not be so dishonorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.01,0:06:57.22,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Besides, Liu Bei's two wives are still in the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.22,0:06:58.08,Default,Cai Yang,0,0,0,,Chancellor, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.28,0:07:06.40,Default,Cai Yang,0,0,0,,Chancellor, look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.40,0:07:07.24,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Cease your drivel!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.44,0:07:14.18,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.43,0:07:20.49,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Many thanks, Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.23,0:07:26.98,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,I gave you a silk cloak, and yet you did not kneel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.98,0:07:31.14,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Yet now I give you a horse, and you kneel in joy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.25,0:07:34.78,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Why do you value beasts over men?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.18,0:07:41.77,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Chancellor, this horse can travel thousands of {\i1}li{\i0} in a day!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.77,0:07:43.72,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,I am blessed to have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.90,0:07:47.96,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Once I know where my elder brother is,\N I can be with him in one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.27,0:07:57.58,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,I treat you with generosity.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.95,0:08:01.12,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Why, then, do you still ponder leaving?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.89,0:08:09.46,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Chancellor, I am grateful for your kindness!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.46,0:08:18.34,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,However, though my body is here, \Nmy heart yearns for Imperial Uncle Liú!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.05,0:08:21.00,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,I can never forget him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.53,0:08:23.98,Default,Zhang Liao,0,0,0,,Brother errs in his words.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.30,0:08:28.33,Default,Zhang Liao,0,0,0,,A man should weigh the value of all matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.38,0:08:30.38,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(280,468)}Zhāng Liáo\NStyled: \NWényuǎn
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.28,0:08:32.95,Default,Zhang Liao,0,0,0,,Lord Xuande's grace may hardly compare to the Chancellor's.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.09,0:08:36.70,Default,Zhang Liao,0,0,0,,Why do you wish to leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.84,0:08:42.70,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,I do know that the Chancellor has given me much,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.41,0:08:49.47,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,but I also received the imperial \Nuncle's love. We swore to die together!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.69,0:08:54.32,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,I will not betray that oath!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.77,0:09:03.64,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Chancellor, I cannot remain here forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.66,0:09:08.58,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,However, I will repay you, sire.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.58,0:09:11.08,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Afterwards, will I depart.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.68,0:09:19.04,Default,Zhang Liao,0,0,0,,Yet if Xuande has left this world, where would you go back to?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.25,0:09:28.83,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,I will follow him to the underworld.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.20,0:09:32.50,Thinking,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Even under me, he has never forgotten his roots.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.50,0:09:35.80,Thinking,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Yunchang truly is a righteous man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.48,0:09:41.63,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Generals, we shall march to Xudu!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.99,0:09:47.05,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Move away!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.53,0:09:58.38,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Return Yunchang home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.56,0:10:01.82,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Sire, after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.82,0:10:03.45,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,After you, Xuande.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.20,0:10:12.04,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(286.857,450.286)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1460,1840)}Liú Bèi\NStyled: Xuándé
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.94,0:10:16.48,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(980.571,448)\fade(255,0,255,0,0,2060,2540)}Yuán Shào\NStyled: Běnchū
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.04,0:10:18.57,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Xuande, your face tells me that something is amiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.85,0:10:25.95,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Xuande,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.85,0:10:30.50,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,I do not know why you are so aggrieved.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.48,0:10:40.84,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,I have no news of my two brothers, \Nand my family is in the hands of that traitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.97,0:10:47.06,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,I cannot avenge my nation, \Nand I cannot avenge my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.50,0:10:51.64,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,How could anyone stay still and not be aggrieved?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.88,0:10:57.14,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,I have long wanted to breach into Xudu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.14,0:11:00.08,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Now, we have a growing army to do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.96,0:11:13.24,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Cao Cao has deceived his lord treacherously. \NIf my Lord were to resist him,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.24,0:11:16.63,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,you will win over heroes all across the realm!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.55,0:11:23.41,Default,Tian Feng,0,0,0,,My lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.04,0:11:27.14,Default,Tian Feng,0,0,0,,when Cao Cao attacked Xu Province,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.14,0:11:31.85,Default,Tian Feng,0,0,0,,he left Xudu vacant, but you did not advance!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.05,0:11:36.14,Default,Tian Feng,0,0,0,,Now Xu Province has been conquered!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.14,0:11:39.22,Default,Tian Feng,0,0,0,,We must not underestimate his strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.30,0:11:43.34,Default,Tian Feng,0,0,0,,It would be better to maintain our position,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.34,0:11:46.68,Default,Tian Feng,0,0,0,,waiting for a chance to strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.68,0:11:53.16,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Sire, Cao Cao is a deceitful traitor who terrorizes the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.16,0:11:55.22,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,If you do not act against him,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.22,0:11:58.04,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,you could lose your prestige among the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.42,0:12:04.20,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Xuande's words are true.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.20,0:12:07.44,Default,Tian Feng,0,0,0,,Sire, Liu Bei's words cannot be trusted!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.44,0:12:07.85,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.72,0:12:12.02,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,You belittle my strength with your tongue!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.02,0:12:13.84,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Do you wish for me to fail and diminish my esteem?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.84,0:12:15.26,Default,Tian Feng,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.36,0:12:16.68,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(971.429,452.571)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1980,2320)}Tián Fēng\NStyled: Yuánhào
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.26,0:12:19.46,Default,Tian Feng,0,0,0,,To ignore our words is to doom our men!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.88,0:12:20.62,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,The gall!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.17,0:12:24.18,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Guards, drag him out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.18,0:12:24.88,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Off with his head!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.88,0:12:25.56,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.81,0:12:30.31,Default,Tian Feng,0,0,0,,Sire, if you ignore our loyal words now, \Nit will be too late for regrets!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.45,0:12:33.31,Default,Officials,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.30,0:12:39.54,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,My lord, Tian Yuanhao has affronted your honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.54,0:12:41.50,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,That is indeed contemptible.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.50,0:12:47.85,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,However, killing your own before a campaign would only harm morale.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.85,0:12:50.48,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,My lord, please reconsider.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.05,0:12:57.10,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Imprison Tian Feng.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.35,0:13:00.68,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,He will remain there until I return from war.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.95,0:13:03.58,Default,Tian Feng,0,0,0,,My lord, my lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.58,0:13:05.74,Default,Tian Feng,0,0,0,,If you ignore loyal advice,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.74,0:13:07.58,Default,Tian Feng,0,0,0,,it will be too late for regrets!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.25,0:13:09.68,Default,Tian Feng,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.44,0:13:12.21,Default,Tian Feng,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.62,0:13:15.82,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,I hereby assign Yan Liang as the vanguard!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.82,0:13:17.08,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,He shall attack Baima!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.77,0:13:22.02,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,The main army shall accompany me as scheduled towards Liyang!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.40,0:13:26.33,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(897.841,228.286)}	Baima
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.02,0:13:22.75,Default,All,0,0,0,,As you wish!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.20,0:13:50.19,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Song Xian!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.19,0:13:50.61,Default,Song Xian,0,0,0,,Here, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.78,0:13:53.88,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,I know you were a fierce warrior-general under Lü Bu.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.88,0:13:56.96,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Would you honor us by taking on Yan Liang?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.75,0:14:00.07,Default,Song Xian,0,0,0,,Chancellor, watch me seize Yan Liang's head!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.81,0:14:12.72,Default,Song Xian,0,0,0,,Witness my strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.88,0:14:23.00,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(326.857,456)}Yán Liáng
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.51,0:14:26.28,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,He truly is a valiant fighter!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.25,0:14:29.54,Default,Wei Xu,0,0,0,,Chancellor, Yan Liang killed my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.54,0:14:31.09,Default,Wei Xu,0,0,0,,I must take revenge!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.09,0:14:31.52,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.59,0:14:37.53,Default,Wei Xu,0,0,0,,Yan Liang! Today, I will send you to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.83,0:15:06.24,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Who will challenge him?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.24,0:15:07.67,Default,Xu Huang,0,0,0,,I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.84,0:15:11.20,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(307.429,488)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2000,2340)}Xú Huǎng\NStyled: Gōngmíng
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.89,0:15:38.62,Default,Generals,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.62,0:15:39.30,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.64,0:15:49.72,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Sound our retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.58,0:15:58.54,Default,Xun You,0,0,0,,Chancellor?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.48,0:16:02.12,Default,Xun You,0,0,0,,I know only one man able to match Yan Liang.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.92,0:16:03.68,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.14,0:16:06.24,Default,Xun You,0,0,0,,Guan Yunchang.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.24,0:16:11.64,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,But he said that he would stay until he repays me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.84,0:16:14.26,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,If he repaid me, he would leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.26,0:16:16.56,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,That is why I kept him away from the fray.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.82,0:16:21.75,Default,Xun You,0,0,0,,Liu Bei should be there, allied with Yuan Shao.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.75,0:16:26.02,Default,Xun You,0,0,0,,If you send Yunchang to crush Yuan Shao's army,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.02,0:16:28.80,Default,Xun You,0,0,0,,Yuan Shao would suspect Liu Bei and kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.55,0:16:30.98,Default,Xun You,0,0,0,,If Liu Bei dies,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.98,0:16:34.44,Default,Xun You,0,0,0,,who would Yunchang follow after him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.83,0:16:43.93,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Good. Send someone to Xudu to get Yunchang immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.77,0:16:59.50,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,The men of Hebei are known to be strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.27,0:17:02.50,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}As I see them,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.37,0:17:05.56,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}they are nothing but a pack of squalid mutts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.64,0:17:14.02,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord8}That rider on the white horse, under the commander's banner,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.02,0:17:17.00,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}with splendid armor and sharp blade is Yan Liang.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.27,0:17:26.20,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12}To me, Yan Liang's head is but merchandise to be taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.98,0:17:31.04,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Do not underestimate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.68,0:17:35.50,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,I may lack talent, but I can charge in,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.50,0:17:38.00,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,seize his head, and present it to you, sire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.00,0:17:41.16,Default,Zhang Liao,0,0,0,,There are no jests in times of war! Yunchang, don't be reckless!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.46,0:17:51.44,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Sound the drums!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.33,0:18:25.04,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,For his slaying of Yan Liang, \NCao Cao valued Guan Yu even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.04,0:18:31.18,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,He had Emperor Xian name Deputy General Guan Yu \Nas the Marquis of Hanshou District,"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.18,0:18:33.61,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,giving him the seal and ribbon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.78,0:18:41.46,Default,Scout,0,0,0,,My lord, my lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.46,0:18:43.84,Default,Scout,0,0,0,,Vanguard general, Yan Liang, has fallen!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.22,0:18:45.20,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.20,0:18:46.40,Default,General,0,0,0,,Who killed Yan Liang?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.29,0:18:51.03,Default,Scout,0,0,0,,A general with a red face and \Na long beard, wielding a glaive!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.03,0:18:53.38,Default,Scout,0,0,0,,His horse burst through our ranks effortlessly!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.38,0:18:56.12,Default,Scout,0,0,0,,He beheaded Yan Liang and crushed our forces!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.32,0:18:59.36,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Who is this man?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.36,0:19:01.98,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,He must be Xuande's brother, Guan Yunchang.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.28,0:19:04.76,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,My lord-
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.76,0:19:07.20,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Your younger brother killed my most favored general!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.69,0:19:09.68,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,You must be colluding with Cao Cao!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.68,0:19:10.27,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Guards!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.27,0:19:10.80,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.15,0:19:13.30,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.30,0:19:16.52,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Sire must not let one-sided words end our alliance!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.52,0:19:20.08,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,For our alliance, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.08,0:19:22.24,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,You may speak your case.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.96,0:19:29.22,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Ever since my defeat at Xu Province,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.22,0:19:31.20,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,I have not known whether Yunchang still lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.20,0:19:33.50,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,There are many who look alike,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.50,0:19:36.90,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,so how could that man happen to be Guan Yu?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.90,0:19:39.09,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,My lord, decide after you have checked.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.09,0:19:41.71,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Did you see the man who killed Yan Liang?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.71,0:19:42.35,Default,Scout,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.94,0:19:46.89,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,I almost killed a decent man because of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.85,0:19:52.82,Default,Wen Chou,0,0,0,,My lord, I swore an oath with General Yan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.82,0:19:54.79,Default,Wen Chou,0,0,0,,I must avenge my brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.79,0:19:57.32,Default,Wen Chou,0,0,0,,Please let me fight the enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.76,0:19:59.71,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Only General Wen can avenge him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.71,0:20:01.34,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Take 100,000 soldiers!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.34,0:20:03.32,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Cross the Yellow River and kill Cao Cao!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.50,0:20:04.57,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,My lord, you must not!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.24,0:20:06.36,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(282.286,450.286)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1850,2120)}Jǔ Shòu
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.20,0:20:07.42,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,We should remain at Yan Ford
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.42,0:20:09.79,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,and send a regiment towards Guandu.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.47,0:20:13.50,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,If we cross the river and the situation goes awry,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.50,0:20:15.36,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,it will be too late to return!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.87,0:20:17.84,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,You burden the army with your talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.84,0:20:20.28,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Any more from you will delay us!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.52,0:20:27.95,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Dispatch the men. We leave immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.03,0:20:30.28,Default,All,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.12,0:20:46.52,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Wen Chou is a famous general. Who'll take him?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.52,0:20:47.74,Default,General,0,0,0,,I'll go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.05,0:20:51.44,Default,General,0,0,0,,En garde, Wen Chou!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.29,0:21:01.50,Default,General,0,0,0,,Don't you dare shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.41,0:21:08.93,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,En garde, knave!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.24,0:21:20.60,Default,Zhang Liao,0,0,0,,General Guan is a true hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.44,0:21:20.36,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(989.333,456)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1620,1920)}Zhāng Liáo\NStyled: Wényuǎn
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.60,0:21:22.40,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Second Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.52,0:21:25.25,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Second Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.17,0:21:28.65,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Second Brother Yunchang!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.10,0:21:32.70,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Did you hear someone call me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.70,0:21:33.17,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.95,0:21:55.80,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Was someone calling me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.54,0:22:04.50,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Liu Bei, what is your excuse this time!?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.80,0:22:11.91,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,What did I do wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.69,0:22:13.54,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,You?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.72,0:22:18.52,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,You had your brother kill a great general!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.52,0:22:20.12,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Is that not wrong?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.47,0:22:22.90,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Take him out and behead him!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.90,0:22:23.18,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.18,0:22:24.78,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.82,0:22:28.84,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Let me have my final word!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.48,0:22:34.28,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Wise liege.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.66,0:22:38.53,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.96,0:22:43.12,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Cao Cao always viewed me with suspicion.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.12,0:22:46.70,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Now he's learned of my residing at Sire's side, he fears our alliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.70,0:22:49.12,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12}That's why he had Yunchang \N kill the two generals
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.12,0:22:55.74,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12}to enrage you, sire, and to make me \Nthe enemy of the noble men of Hebei.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.74,0:22:59.44,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}He is twisting your hands to kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.09,0:23:16.82,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}In all of Hebei's greatness,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.60,0:23:22.20,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12)}is there not one man who can testify to my innocence!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.28,0:23:31.72,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Have I been forsaken by all?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.33,0:23:40.76,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Xuande, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.74,0:23:47.11,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Xuande, what you said is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.21,0:23:53.62,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,You people almost had me harm a virtuous man!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.04,0:24:07.36,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Your Lordship, I must repay your clemency.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.36,0:24:11.60,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,I will send a trusted messenger to Yunchang
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.60,0:24:13.22,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,so he will have news of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.22,0:24:15.72,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,He will speed overnight to join us
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.72,0:24:18.17,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,and assist you, sire, in executing Cao Cao,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.17,0:24:20.50,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,thereby avenging Yan Liang and Wen Chou!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.50,0:24:21.69,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.33,0:24:24.90,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,If I can get Yunchang,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.90,0:24:27.40,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,I will have the strength of ten Yans and Wens!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.40,0:24:28.16,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.29,0:24:32.34,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,Let us fetch brush and ink.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.43,0:24:35.88,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,Write your messenge in front of everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.05,0:24:45.91,Default,Chen Zhen,0,0,0,,General Guan!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.96,0:24:47.82,Default,Chen Zhen,0,0,0,,General Guan!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.04,0:24:49.77,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.55,0:24:52.51,Default,Chen Zhen,0,0,0,,An old acquaintance of yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.65,0:24:56.80,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Let him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.80,0:24:57.12,Default,Servant,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.78,0:25:01.53,Default,Chen Zhen,0,0,0,,General Guan!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.82,0:25:05.14,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Sir, who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.65,0:25:07.28,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,How are we acquainted?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.72,0:25:08.56,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1000,449.143)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1620,1840)}Chén Zhèn\NStyled: Xiàoqǐ
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.28,0:25:09.18,Default,Chen Zhen,0,0,0,,I am Yuan Shao's subordinate,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.18,0:25:10.60,Default,Chen Zhen,0,0,0,,Chen Zhen of Nanyang.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.36,0:25:16.30,Default,Chen Zhen,0,0,0,,Liu Bei penned this letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.30,0:25:17.95,Default,Chen Zhen,0,0,0,,General Guan, please read it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.50,0:25:42.80,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}"You and I made an oath at the Peach Garden; we swore to die as brothers."
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.20,0:25:46.64,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}"Yet now a rift is between our path, how could you forget our promise?"
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.47,0:25:55.14,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}"But if you wish for fame and fortune, to achieve your triumph, my head is yours for the taking,"
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.26,0:25:59.24,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}"I will not say a word, none would suffice. \NI will await my death."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.18,0:26:01.15,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Elder Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.15,0:26:03.14,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Elder Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.02,0:26:10.78,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,It's not that I don't want to find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.97,0:26:17.28,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,But I don't know where you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.21,0:26:28.74,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Brother, how could I betray \Nour oath for wealth and glory?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.82,0:26:42.62,Default,Chen Zhen,0,0,0,,Xuande hopes to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.02,0:26:46.54,Default,Chen Zhen,0,0,0,,If you do not want to betray your oath,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.54,0:26:48.60,Default,Chen Zhen,0,0,0,,then you should go see him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.40,0:27:05.89,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}When people live in this world,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.11,0:27:12.96,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}those who betray their goals deserve no respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.84,0:27:21.29,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I came here openly, and I must leave the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.55,0:27:30.57,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Let me write a letter. I ask you to give it to my Elder Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.32,0:27:33.24,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}That once I leave Cao Cao,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.52,0:27:41.08,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I and the two ladies will see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.69,0:27:44.30,Default,Chen Zhen,0,0,0,,And if Cao Cao will not let you leave,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.30,0:27:45.52,Default,Chen Zhen,0,0,0,,what then?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.72,0:27:51.74,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,I would rather leave by dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.55,0:27:54.12,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,How could I remain here?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.93,0:27:59.55,Default,Chen Zhen,0,0,0,,Sir, you should write a reply to reassure Lord Liu.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.16,0:28:16.38,Thinking,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Men who are righteous will not betray;
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.38,0:28:18.98,Thinking,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}men who are loyal do not fear death.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.98,0:28:24.14,Thinking,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12)}Since youth, I've learned honor and integrity from books,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.14,0:28:27.70,Thinking,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12}from stories such as that of \NYangjue Ai and Zuo Botao,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.70,0:28:31.76,Thinking,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}to which I always gasped and wept.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.14,0:28:31.80,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Yang Jue'ai and Zuo Botao were sworn brothers. During a freezing blizzard, Zuo Botao gave all his clothes and food to Yang Jue'ai, sacrificing his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.88,0:28:34.78,Thinking,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}When I guarded Xiapi,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.78,0:28:38.22,Thinking,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I did not have enough food inside or soldiers outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.80,0:28:40.65,Thinking,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I would have accepted death.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.36,0:28:43.89,Thinking,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}But I would be abandoning the two sisters-in-law,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.89,0:28:49.26,Thinking,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12}I would not dare to sacrifice myself, lest I betray your trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.26,0:28:54.16,Thinking,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Thus, I yielded for the time being, \Nuntil our hopeful reunion.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.16,0:28:58.01,Thinking,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Now that I have received Elder Brother's letter,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.01,0:29:01.79,Thinking,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12}I shall leave sir Cáo,\N and return with my sisters-in-law.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.79,0:29:04.82,Thinking,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12}If my heart wavers in the slightest, may the gods strike me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.84,0:29:07.56,Thinking,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Ink and paper cannot convey every word of our bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.20,0:29:11.60,Thinking,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Soon, I hope, I can be by your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.17,0:29:39.69,Default,Zhang Liao,0,0,0,,I know my brother's heart, I know you are troubled.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.92,0:29:44.96,Default,Zhang Liao,0,0,0,,If there are complaints, I am willing to hear them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.29,0:29:48.99,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Wenyuan, what is the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.08,0:29:57.22,Default,Zhang Liao,0,0,0,,I heard that you received news of Xuande. I'm here to congratulate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.41,0:30:00.95,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Although my lord lives,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.97,0:30:03.29,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,I have not seen him yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.55,0:30:07.16,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,What is there to congratulate?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.75,0:30:18.32,Default,Zhang Liao,0,0,0,,The relationship between you and Xuande...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.07,0:30:24.97,Default,Zhang Liao,0,0,0,,how does it compare to ours?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.12,0:30:33.36,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,You and I are friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.83,0:30:38.09,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Xuande and I are friends, and brothers most of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.67,0:30:42.10,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,We are also lord and vassal.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.95,0:30:44.52,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,How could you compare the two?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.24,0:30:52.70,Default,Zhang Liao,0,0,0,,Now that Xuande is at Hebei,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.70,0:30:55.84,Default,Zhang Liao,0,0,0,,are you going there or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.73,0:31:01.20,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Would I go back on my past words?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.83,0:31:10.84,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Wenyuan, you must see the \NChancellor and convey my will.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.17,0:31:18.64,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Yunchang has decided?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.76,0:31:24.56,Default,Zhang Liao,0,0,0,,He spoke honestly, quickly, and clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.24,0:31:33.08,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Well then, I should have never agreed to his terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.72,0:31:37.49,Default,Zhang Liao,0,0,0,,Chancellor, if not for your promise,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.49,0:31:39.30,Default,Zhang Liao,0,0,0,,would Yunchang ever follow us?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.43,0:31:44.60,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.49,0:31:48.92,Default,Zhang Liao,0,0,0,,It will be a pity if we let him go,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.54,0:31:56.69,Default,Zhang Liao,0,0,0,,but if we force Yunchang to stay, he will resist.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.98,0:32:00.92,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,And that is my dilemma!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.05,0:32:06.90,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Wenyuan,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.50,0:32:08.44,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,you may leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.42,0:32:15.17,Default,Zhang Liao,0,0,0,,Chancellor?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.82,0:32:18.08,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,I have my own way of keeping him here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.93,0:32:21.52,Default,Zhang Liao,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.04,0:32:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,"Do Not Disturb"
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.77,0:32:58.82,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,I think Wenyuan told him my intentions,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.82,0:33:00.64,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,for the Chancellor is avoiding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.48,0:33:21.68,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Inform General Zhang that \NI have urgent matters to discuss!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.68,0:33:23.22,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,General Zhang is resting.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.22,0:33:25.16,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,He will not receive any visitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.89,0:33:31.62,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Sir, when you go back inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.62,0:33:33.64,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,tell him that Guan Yu wants to see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.60,0:33:37.20,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,I know, but I am under specific orders from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.20,0:33:39.14,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,General Guan, you are no exception.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.22,0:33:40.89,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.63,0:33:42.84,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Sir, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.92,0:33:56.58,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Wenyuan, aren't I a guest?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.58,0:33:59.88,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,How can you sleep to avoid my visit!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.88,0:34:01.50,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,If you won't see me,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.50,0:34:03.82,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,I will go see the Chancellor once more!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.68,0:34:50.96,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Please tell me, sir, why won't the Chancellor see guests?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.66,0:34:53.62,Default,Old Servant,0,0,0,,I'm only a servant within the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.62,0:34:56.84,Default,Old Servant,0,0,0,,I know nothing about the Chancellor's affairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.06,0:34:59.24,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,You know nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.65,0:35:01.10,Default,Old Servant,0,0,0,,Indeed I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.52,0:35:06.66,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Then my mind is set.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.15,0:35:08.67,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,How could I stay any longer?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.89,0:35:17.56,Default,Hanshou Servant,0,0,0,,General.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.83,0:35:35.97,Default,Hanshou Servant,0,0,0,,General.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.62,0:35:43.10,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Have you searched carefully?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.10,0:35:45.67,Default,Hanshou Servant,0,0,0,,I'd never fail you by making mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.46,0:35:48.36,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.18,0:35:51.18,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Then tell the Chancellor this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.18,0:35:52.72,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,All of these gifts...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.21,0:35:57.56,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,They must remain here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.67,0:36:05.22,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Do not touch any of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.22,0:36:06.00,Default,Hanshou Servant,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.49,0:36:11.03,Default,Hanshou Servant,0,0,0,,Only...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.62,0:36:13.36,Default,Hanshou Servant,0,0,0,,General.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.59,0:36:21.05,Default,Hanshou Servant,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}This seal was granted to you by the dynasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.05,0:36:23.66,Default,Hanshou Servant,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}General, you should keep it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.42,0:37:07.87,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}No, it was the Chancellor who granted the seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.59,0:37:10.40,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Leave it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.20,0:37:19.12,Default,Women,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.17,0:37:31.50,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"I heard that my former master is with Yuan Shao."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.50,0:37:33.50,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"In the past, I swore an oath with him."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.50,0:37:35.30,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"How could I ever betray it?"
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.30,0:37:38.34,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"Despite your generosity, I cannot forget his either."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.34,0:37:40.82,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"Thus, I have left this special message."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.82,0:37:42.24,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"This is with all due respect."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.24,0:37:46.04,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord8}"I have not fully repaid your kindness,\N and I hope to do so one day."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.80,0:37:55.80,Default,Hanshou Servant,0,0,0,,Reporting to the Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.80,0:37:59.38,Default,Hanshou Servant,0,0,0,,Guan Yu has locked away all the gifted gold and silver.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.38,0:38:02.01,Default,Hanshou Servant,0,0,0,,The ten beauties are housed in a separate room.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.01,0:38:05.02,Default,Hanshou Servant,0,0,0,,The Marquis' seal of Hanshou has been hung up at the hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.02,0:38:08.08,Default,Hanshou Servant,0,0,0,,The men that you assigned have all been left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.08,0:38:12.12,Default,Hanshou Servant,0,0,0,,He only took his own followers and \Nluggage, leaving from the north gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.70,0:38:27.30,Default,Cai Yang,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.73,0:38:33.60,Default,Cai Yang,0,0,0,,I, Cai Yang, can capture Guan Yu\N with three thousand cavalry!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.94,0:38:37.53,Default,Cai Yang,0,0,0,,Chancellor, why not give the order?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.15,0:38:46.22,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Never forgetting his roots,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.22,0:38:48.26,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,coming and leaving with clarity...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.78,0:38:50.28,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,What a true man!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.50,0:38:56.68,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,All of you should follow his example.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.68,0:38:59.04,Default,Cai Yang,0,0,0,,Chancellor, are you really letting him go?!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.27,0:39:00.98,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Everybody, back down!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.98,0:39:02.76,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Do not speak of this again!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.92,0:39:17.90,Default,Xun You,0,0,0,,{\bord12\}You have treated Guan Yu extraordinarily well, yet he left without even a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.90,0:39:19.46,Default,Xun You,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Add that to his letter
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.46,0:39:22.12,Default,Xun You,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}and he meant to humiliate you egregiously.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.09,0:39:25.65,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Now if you let him join Yuan Shao,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.65,0:39:28.12,Default,Xun You,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}that is just adding wings to a tiger!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.80,0:39:32.32,Default,Xun You,0,0,0,,{\bord12}If you do not hunt him down, he will become a threat later.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.39,0:39:34.59,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.50,0:39:41.53,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I made a promise to him. I cannot break it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.58,0:39:45.39,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Each man has their own lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.16,0:39:47.48,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}You will not chase him!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.37,0:39:54.32,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Wenyuan.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.81,0:39:56.26,Default,Zhang Liao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.22,0:39:59.97,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Yunchang has abandoned his seal and the gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.14,0:40:06.55,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Riches could not sway his loyalty, \Ntitles could not stir his ambitions.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.55,0:40:09.60,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Such men have my utmost respect!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.48,0:40:14.94,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}He won't have gone far, I will do him one last favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.49,0:40:20.26,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Wenyuan, have Yunchang await my escort.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.42,0:40:25.60,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord8}Gift him a warrior's cloak\N and passage for the journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.61,0:40:30.44,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Let them be our parting memory.

